# Anything listed here is never uploaded, even by a manual `vercel --prod`.
#
# This file exists because `vercel --prod` uploads the local folder rather than
# the repo, so untracked working files get published silently. That is how the
# Autograph client offer deck — plus all 15 of its draft versions — ended up
# publicly readable at /autograph with no password.

# Client offer decks and their drafts. Never public.
autograph/

# Internal handover notes.
docs/

# Local noise
.DS_Store
*.log
versions/
